减去底面上$p_infinity$的贡献

$ D_2 = p_infinity pi r^2 $

取参考面积为底面面积.得到阻力系数

$ C_D = (D_1-D_2)/(q_infinity pi r^2) = (p-p_infinity)/(q_infinity) = C_p $

